        "nobel_worthiness": "Photonic band gaps gave a profound and productive way to control light through material structure, with lasting scientific and technological influence.",
        "attribution": "Yablonovitch and John made seminal independent proposals; Joannopoulos was highly influential in theoretical and practical development.",
        "maturity": "The central physics has been observed in many systems and underpins a mature field of structured photonics.",
        "uncertainties": ["The balance between the original independent proposals and later realization and application requires close historical scrutiny."]
      }
    },
